{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24505","headline":"春晚咏怀赠皇甫朗之 · 白居易","name":"春晚咏怀赠皇甫朗之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"艳阳时节又蹉跎，迟暮光阴复若何。\n一岁平分春日少，百年通计老时多。\n多中更被愁牵引，少处兼遭病折磨。\n赖有销忧治闷药，君家浓酎我狂歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}